      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ONYX FLAME (4) has placed at the last three runs since a win and still yet to miss the frame, the latest finishing second (21.83) at Q Lakeside. Has never missed the frame at the trip from three starts. Expected to feature in the finish. USHUAIA (2) claimed his maiden two back when strongly fancied to break through then third last time, beaten 4 lengths (21.98) at Q Lakeside over 390m. Drawn well from box 2. Can measure up this time. FEDERAL DEUCE (1) showed good early burn and was there until turning but swamped late to finish 7th at Q Parklands in Grade 6 company. Should be in this for a long way. ATOMIC BOOM (7) has ability and can find the frame.",
